// `match`, `if let`, `let else`: each pattern becomes a test plus bindings, arms an `If` chain or one `Switch`
// (int arms, no guards); a guarded match keeps a `done` flag.
//
// Part of module j3c.lower.
// Port of: j3c/src/check/lower/pat/mod.rs,
// check/lower/pat/check.rs (exhaustiveness, int values, range overlap: run by sema on the typed tree, B11.1)
// J3: The checks are type decisions, so they live in a sema part when ported; this part only lowers a match
//     sema has already accepted.
// J3: The code is in the `pat_` parts (contracts-c2b.md): `pat_match.j3` (arms, `Switch`, the guarded chain,
// let patterns), `pat_test.j3` (one pattern's test and bindings); `?` is in `enums.j3`.
module j3c.lower;
